		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">48</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Variables approach will look like below.
let a_count = 0, b_count = 0, and so on z_count = 0;
for each character c in word {
    if (c === "a") {
        a_count++;
    } else if (c === "b") {
        b_count++;
    } and so on until else if (c === "z") {
        z_count++;
    }
}

There are multiple issues with this approach.</attribute>
