			<attribute key="id" type="int">66</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer. Here, we are searching for an element by its value. For this, we have to compare it with every element in the array. So, the time depends on the length of the array. Compared to other lines, this is the most time taking line. It is O(m), where m is the length of charsArray.</attribute>
