		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">69</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer. Each iteration of the for loop takes O(m), where m is the length of charsArray. Worst case is where, in every iteration, we encounter a new character. So, the size of charsArrays increases in every execution. So, it will be 0 + 1 + 2 + ... + (n-1). This is O(n^2).</attribute>
