		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">82</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This looks very similar to the arrays approach. But, its time complexity is different.

If you haven't gone through other approaches, we strongly recommend you to go through them first and then come back to hashmap approach.
That will help you realise how there can be multiple correct solutions for a single problem. It will also make you appreciate the importance of data structures and complexity analysis.</attribute>
