		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">108</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">To summarise, hashmap approach has a time complexity of O(n) and extra space complexity of O(n). On the other hand arrays approach has a time complexity of O(n^2) and extra space complexity of O(n). So, hashmap approach has a better time complexity than the arrays approach.</attribute>
