			<section name="LabelGraphics">
				<attribute key="text" type="String">Next step is to convert the algorithm into code.
Note that we have not written even a single line of code until now. Some part of the algorithm may look like code. It is written to avoid long and confusing sentences. But it is not real code.
Algorithm design is done on a paper, not in a computer.</attribute>
