		</section>
		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">113</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Fact: The above algorithm has some partial code in it. It is called pseudo-code. Pseudo-code is not complete code. At the same time, it is also not complete English. It is a mix of both. Quite often, developers use pseudo-code to express algorithms.</attribute>
