			<attribute key="id" type="int">114</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Let us convert the algorithm step by step. It is a long algorithm, so we will discuss the major aspects of the implementation. Basic aspects like creating/updating variables, writing conditional blocks, loops etc. are not discussed here. If you are not clear on such basic aspects, please revise the assignments from STOC module.</attribute>
