			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are the major aspects from the above algorithm.
a. Store the counts of unique characters from a string (steps 2 and 4)
b. Iterating over the keys of a hashmap (step 9)
c. Check if a key is present in a hashmap (step 10)
d. Retrieve a value from a hashmap, using a key (step 13)</attribute>
